#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:3
#: e84abf9f801a49db8ca9559a6a938e06
msgid ""
"**React Hero Books interface:** owns the current mission, prompt assignment,"
" learner-visible state, and progression decision."
msgstr ""
"**React Hero Books interface:** owns the current mission, prompt assignment,"
" learner-visible state, and progression decision."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:4
#: f38c40caf4b042bfbf5937a9b2e620dc
msgid ""
"**MV3 content bridge:** publishes `MissionEnvelope.v2` and admits bound "
"Builder and Colab receipts; it does not use `BroadcastChannel` or scrape "
"Colab."
msgstr ""
"**MV3 content bridge:** publishes `MissionEnvelope.v2` and admits bound "
"Builder and Colab receipts; it does not use `BroadcastChannel` or scrape "
"Colab."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:5
#: 221ef64dcc964196928b0e0f6138f698
msgid ""
"**Teacher planning surface:** receives bounded planning projections rather "
"than raw learner evidence."
msgstr ""
"**Teacher planning surface:** receives bounded planning projections rather "
"than raw learner evidence."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:6
#: b03bc76f30f24b2680b2e1c6844732eb
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Vite development server:** local browser runtime used by the documented "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"**Vite development server:** local browser runtime used by the documented "
"tests."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:8
#: 9df1809ed3de4aaaac08a749bdda4b8c
msgid "Interface contract"
msgstr "Contrato de interfaz"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:10
#: 324a24007d904f12b4d0d1e481ff25fb
msgid ""
"Inputs must be explicit, outputs must be inspectable, errors must be "
"returned as errors, and consequential external actions require human "
"approval."
msgstr ""
"Las entradas deben ser explicitas, las salidas inspeccionables, los errores "
"devueltos como errores y las acciones externas importantes requieren "
"aprobacion humana."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:12
#: caf37d15324a4498a8349312d70252cc
msgid ""
"Receipt admission recomputes canonical digests and rejects stale missions, "
"wrong run or artifact bindings, secret-like fields, identity data, failed "
"tests, and malformed broker attestations."
msgstr ""
"Receipt admission recomputes canonical digests and rejects stale missions, "
"wrong run or artifact bindings, secret-like fields, identity data, failed "
"tests, and malformed broker attestations."

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:14
#: c34e241de9674d89b39b4d069b1ce147
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "Compatibilidad"

#: ../../docs/tools/algoquest-qbit/interfaces.md:16
#: c726957d4f984cfb8def8937e95b130b
msgid ""
"Treat undocumented endpoints, commands, and browser controls as unsupported."
" Confirm the current repository version before integrating another system."
msgstr ""
"Considere no compatibles los endpoints, comandos y controles del navegador "
"no documentados. Confirme la version actual del repositorio antes de "
"integrar otro sistema."

